{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 38, :comments ["<b>In the fifth month, on the first of the month.</b> This is the New Moon on which Aaron died, and on the ninth of it the Temple was burned and the Torah with it, and on the seventh of Adar in the following year after this, Moses our master, peace be upon him, died — for thus it is written in the book of Joshua (4) that Israel crossed the Jordan on the tenth of the first month; count backward from there three days for the preparation of provisions and thirty days for the mourning of Moses, peace be upon him, and you find they conclude on the seventh of Adar."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:37:44.470816394Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}